          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, column I (left side)",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Friday the 4th</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">five and 1/2 qin\u1e6d\u0101rs (550 pounds)</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ab\u016b Kath\u012br 6 the woman from Sicily 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">R. Mena\u1e25em 5 the o[rph]ans of Ibrah\u012bm 3</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ab\u016b Mukht\u0101r and his sister and his son 9</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Za\u02bffar\u0101n 8 a man from Andalus and his son 5</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the wife of \u02bfAw\u0101\u1e0d H\u0101r\u016bn of Jerusalem 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the woman from Barqa 4 Af\u016bn\u012b</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the female proselyte 4 the sons of Ra\u1e25amim 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a female guide (of the blind) 1 Nathan 2 b. Shekhanya 6</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the acquaintance of the dyer 3 al-\u1e62\u016br\u0101n\u012b the Kohen</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the mother-in-law of Elia and the orphan boy 2 the acquaintance of Umm Sur\u016br</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Elia \u201cthe short\u201d 2 the wife of the deceased elder 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ab\u016b Khal\u012bf and his [...] 5 \u1e62\u0101li\u1e25 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Mub\u0101raka 4 Umm Furayj 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a newcomer from R\u016bm 4 the two acquaintances of Azhar 16</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sitt\u0101n [...] the acquaintance of the man from Damietta 7</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">b. Yi\u1e25ye 3 the daughter of al-Thulayth 2</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
