          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, column IV (right side)",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Joseph the night watchman 5 the wife of the tanner 5</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ya\u02bfq\u016bb 3 Makhl\u016bf 2 b. al-\u02bfAmm\u0101n\u012b 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u00a0Barak\u0101t the supervisor 4 \u02bfAyy\u0101sh 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the mother-in-law of the R\u016bm [...]</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ma\u02bfla\u02be10 a blin[d woman] 5 a woman from Ma[l\u012b] 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a female teacher 3 KL[...] 3 Ab\u016b a[l-...]</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Na\u02bf\u012bm 4 a cantor from Ascalon 6</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a newcomer from Baghdad 6</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the orphans of the furrier 5 Shi\u1e25iy\u0101 4\u00a0</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a semiparalyzed woman 2 Shalom the scribe 3</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the female washer of the dead for Fustat 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sulaym\u0101n the supervisor 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Umm I[b]rahim 4 Hil\u0101l 2</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
